Error: Jet.ReactiveArgumentNotLambda: `reactive.derived` needs a lambda, not Int (a whole number)
  --> Tests/UI/reactive_derived_not_lambda.jet:4:26
    |
  4 |     d := reactive.derived(42)
    |                           ^^
 Why: A reactive derived is built from a `fn() { … }` body so it can re-run when a signal changes
 Fix: Write `reactive.derived(fn() { … })`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ReactiveArgumentNotLambda
